ticket.steps:
1. Turn on debug profiling;
2. Open Prestashop Front Office and check executed SQL queries count;
3. Add this code 

```
if ($compile_id === null) {
            $compile_id = Context::getContext()->shop->theme->getName();
        }
```

4. in the beggining of **Module** (`Prestashop /classes/module/Module.php`) class function **isCached**;
5. Open Prestashop Front Office in separate window and check SQL queries count;
6. Second time queries count should be lower;

